"""
Advanced Gradio online inference for Wan2.2 TI2V-5B + VACE (ARXX5).

Features:
- Choose an ARXX5 episode/chunk as initialization.
- Action textbox is auto-filled with the selected raw action (14 dims: left6 + left gripper + right6 + right gripper).
- For one chunk, every step uses the same user action.
- Export traj map, ray map, generated three-view results, and an approximate URDF stick figure.
"""

